			"Message": "style(Rest): Enforce double quotes and standardize node.js import order\n\nRefactor the `Rest.js` CLI wrapper to use double quotes for all string literals and reorganize imports into a canonical order: `child_process`, `fs`, `path`, `url`. Adjust the `execSync` invocation to utilize multi-line formatting for the argument mapping logic, improving readability while maintaining strict argument escaping for the binary execution.\n\nThese changes align the `Rest.js` entry point with the project's code style conventions, ensuring consistency with the recently enforced POSIX-compliant shell script and Rust source formatting standards.",
