			"Message": "style(Rest): Enforce single quotes and consistent formatting in CLI wrapper\n\nStandardize the `Rest.js` entry point to use single quotes for all string literals and remove unnecessary whitespace within the `execSync` invocation. Align the import statement ordering with project conventions.\n\nThis change ensures the CLI wrapper adheres to the strict PascalCase and style guidelines defined for the Rest bundler tooling, maintaining consistency with the recent POSIX-compliant shell script refactorings in the project.",
