			],
			"Message": "feat(Rest): Integrate telemetry initialization and refactor shell scripts\n\nAdd shared dual-pipe telemetry initialization (PostHog + OTLP) to the Rest binary entry point (`Source/Main.rs`) via the `Common` library dependency, enabling tiered observability for the bundler while maintaining a no-op default in release builds.\n\nRefactor `Bench.sh`, `prepublishOnly.sh`, and `run_tests.sh` to enforce strict POSIX-compliant formatting. This includes standardizing redirection spacing (`> /dev/null`), normalizing quote styles, and aligning pipe operators to match the project's shell scripting standards.\n\nUpdate `CHANGELOG.md` with comprehensive v2.1 documentation detailing the OXC 0.127 migration, binary entry point separation, and PascalCase compliance. Additionally, restructure `tests/lib.rs` into explicit `integration` and `unit` namespaces for clearer test organization, and reformat `Source/Fn/OXC/Codegen.rs` for improved readability.",
